poff_amended_at and pickup_amended_at are null, amended_optimal_distance_km is null), so POL-RD-05 cannot run and no re-quoted optimal exists to measure against. The trip was metered, so the fare charged only for the distance and time actually driven, and the distance component is in fact slightly below the optimal route. The chat log (EV-CHAT-00536) is empty, so POL-RD-04 is unavailable and the driver's claimed notice to the rider is unrecorded; there is no rider instruction to weigh in either direction.\n\nOn the driver's record: deviation_flags_90d is 0 against 250 completed trips in 90 days, so no repeat-deviation pattern is established and no POL-RD-06 full-refund uplift or driver-conduct referral is licensed. The threshold facts are not in dispute — trip_record, gps_trace and fare_breakdown all carry trip_id TRP-00536 with a consistent pickup window — and the rider brings no corroboration handicap (deviation_claims_60d 0).\n\nOutcome: NO_ACTION. The 10.29 charge (payment_status CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00) stands as it is; nothing is refunded to the rider and no compensation is paid to the driver. Confidence is 0.90, above the 0.70 floor, so no escalation is triggered. If the rider wishes to pursue the short drop as a service-failure matter rather than a route deviation, that is a separate question this category does not price, and it belongs with support rather than here.",
